In the `database_observability.mysql` block, add the settings that let Alloy maintain the Performance Schema consumers and actor tracking you granted privileges for in the previous milestone:

```alloy
database_observability.mysql "mysql_mysql_primary" {
  // ...generated attributes...

  allow_update_performance_schema_settings = true

  query_samples {
    auto_enable_setup_consumers = true
  }

  setup_actors {
    auto_update_setup_actors = true
  }
}
```

Skip this step if you chose to manage consumers and tracking manually.
